{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpExists\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpExists</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Normalizes existentially quantified propositions:\n`Grind.exists_or`, `Grind.exists_and_left`, `Grind.exists_and_right`, `Grind.exists_prop`,\n`Grind.exists_const`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpExists","kind":"def","line":267,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpExists","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L267-L305"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpForall\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpForall</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Normalizes universally quantified propositions and implications:\n`Grind.imp_true_eq`, `Grind.imp_false_eq`, `Grind.true_imp_eq`,\n`Grind.false_imp_eq`, `Grind.imp_self_eq`, `Grind.forall_true`, `forall_false`,\n`Grind.forall_or_forall`, `Grind.forall_forall_or`, `Grind.forall_and` (see `forallImpAnd?`).","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpForall","kind":"def","line":205,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpForall","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L205-L265"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.reduceCtorEq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">reduceCtorEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reduces `c₁ ... = c₂ ...` to `False` for distinct constructors `c₁` and `c₂`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.reduceCtorEq","kind":"def","line":187,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.reduceCtorEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L187-L195"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpOr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpOr</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Normalizes disjunctions: units, right-associativity, and universally quantified disjuncts\nmoved to the front.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpOr","kind":"def","line":166,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpOr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L166-L185"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.pushNot\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">pushNot</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Pushes negations inwards through the propositional connectives, `ite`, and the quantifiers.\nNegated arithmetic comparisons are handled by the rewrite rules `Nat.not_le_eq` and\n`Int.not_le_eq`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.pushNot","kind":"def","line":130,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.pushNot","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L130-L164"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpDIte\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpDIte</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Converts `dite` with non-dependent branches into `ite`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpDIte","kind":"def","line":119,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpDIte","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L119-L128"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpEq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Normalizes equalities:\n- `Bool`: `true = b` becomes `b = true`; `(a && b) = c` becomes `((a && b) = true) = (c = true)`.\n- `a = a` becomes `True`, `p = True` becomes `p`, `p = False` becomes `¬p`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpEq","kind":"def","line":90,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L90-L117"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpMatchDiscrsOnly\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpMatchDiscrsOnly</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`Grind.simpMatchDiscrsOnly m`, where `m` is a `match` application: only the discriminants of `m`\nare simplified, the alternatives are not visited. The annotation stays and is erased by\n`eraseSimpMatchDiscrsOnly` after normalization.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpMatchDiscrsOnly","kind":"def","line":65,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.simpMatchDiscrsOnly","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L65-L81"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.preMatchCond\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">preMatchCond</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`Grind.PreMatchCond p` is left as is: `p` is a condition of a `match` equation and must keep\nthe shape produced by `annotateMatchEqnType`; `replacePreMatchCond` turns it into\n`Grind.MatchCond` after normalization.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.preMatchCond","kind":"def","line":56,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.preMatchCond","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L56-L63"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.eraseMData\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NormSym</span>.<span class=\"name\">eraseMData</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Simproc\">Sym.Simp.Simproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Erases metadata. `grind` never internalizes `Expr.mdata`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.eraseMData","kind":"def","line":51,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.NormSym.eraseMData","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/NormSymProcs.lean#L51-L54"}}],"imports":["Init.ByCases","Init.Grind.Lemmas","Init.Grind.Norm","Init.Grind.Util","Lean.Meta.AppBuilder","Lean.Meta.CtorRecognizer","Lean.Meta.Match.MatcherInfo","Lean.Meta.Sym.AlphaShareBuilder","Lean.Meta.Sym.InferType","Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateS","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.App","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Result","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.SimpM","Lean.Meta.Sym.SynthInstance","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.ForallAnd"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.NormSymProcs"}